# Cryptcaller Chariot: Crew 2 and menace. Bot1 casts it and a Forsaken Miner (2/2) on turn 1; on turn 3 the Miner (power 2,
# exactly enough, CR 702.122a) crews it and it attacks as a 5/5. Bot2's lone Elvish Mystic can't block it (menace, CR
# 702.111b) but the Mystic and the Llanowar Elves together can: the Chariot assigns 1 to the Mystic and 4 to the Elves and
# survives their 2 damage.

